---
/** 发文热力图：按年-月统计（构建期计算，真实数据；滚动进入时 60ms 交错点亮） */
import type { Post } from "../utils/posts";

interface Props {
  posts: Post[];
}
const { posts } = Astro.props;

const byMonth = new Map<string, number>();
for (const p of posts) {
  const k = `${p.data.pubDate.getUTCFullYear()}-${String(p.data.pubDate.getUTCMonth() + 1).padStart(2, "0")}`;
  byMonth.set(k, (byMonth.get(k) ?? 0) + 1);
}
const years = [...new Set([...byMonth.keys()].map((k) => Number(k.slice(0, 4))))].sort();
const max = Math.max(...byMonth.values(), 1);
const MONTHS = ["1月", "2月", "3月", "4月", "5月", "6月", "7月", "8月", "9月", "10月", "11月", "12月"];
const level = (n: number) => (n === 0 ? 0 : Math.ceil((n / max) * 4));
---

<section class="heatmap-wrap" aria-label="折腾热力图">
  <h2 class="sec-title">折腾热力</h2>
  <div class="hm-scroll">
    <div class="hm-grid" style={`--cols:${years.length}`}>
      <span class="hm-corner"></span>
      {
        years.map((y) => (
          <span class="hm-year nums">
            {y}
          </span>
        ))
      }
      {
        MONTHS.map((m, mi) => (
          <>
            <span class="hm-month">{m}</span>
            {years.map((y) => {
              const k = `${y}-${String(mi + 1).padStart(2, "0")}`;
              const n = byMonth.get(k) ?? 0;
              return (
                <span
                  class:list={["hm-cell", `lv${level(n)}`, n > 0 && "has"]}
                  style={`--i:${years.indexOf(y) * 12 + mi}`}
                  data-reveal
                  title={`${k}：${n > 0 ? `${n} 篇` : "沉寂"}`}
                />
              );
            })}
          </>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hm-legend" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="hm-legend-label">沉寂</span>
    {[0, 1, 2, 3, 4].map((l) => <span class:list={["hm-cell", "lv" + l, "sm"]} />)}
    <span class="hm-legend-label">高产</span>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .heatmap-wrap {
    margin-top: 64px;
    padding-top: 32px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--c-border);
  }
  .sec-title {
    font-size: var(--fs-xl);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .hm-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
    scrollbar-width: thin;
  }
  .hm-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3.2em repeat(var(--cols), 1fr);
    gap: 4px;
    min-width: min(100%, 24rem);
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .hm-year {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--c-fg-subtle);
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .hm-month {
    color: var(--c-fg-subtle);
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    white-space: nowrap;
    align-self: center;
  }
  .hm-cell {
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: var(--c-surface-2);
    transition: transform var(--mo-fast) var(--mo-ease);
  }
  .hm-cell.sm {
    width: 12px;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
  }
  .hm-cell.lv1 { background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--c-accent) 22%, var(--c-surface-2)); }
  .hm-cell.lv2 { background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--c-accent) 45%, var(--c-surface-2)); }
  .hm-cell.lv3 { background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--c-accent) 70%, var(--c-surface-2)); }
  .hm-cell.lv4 { background: var(--c-accent); }
  .hm-cell.has:hover {
    transform: scale(1.25);
  }
  .hm-legend {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .hm-legend-label {
    color: var(--c-fg-subtle);
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    margin: 0 3px;
  }
</style>
